[CHANGE] benchmarks/runs/ring_buffer_qwen_moe_1/parts/ring_buffer/tests/ring_buffer_impl_test.py: Implemented comprehensive test suite for RingBuffer singleton covering all contracts from low/ring_buffer_impl.pyi and low/ring_buffer.pyi: property invariants (capacity=10, initial size=0, is_empty, is_full), push happy-path (no eviction returns None, FIFO order), push overwrite eviction (returns evicted oldest item, maintains capacity), pop happy-path (returns oldest, decrements size, FIFO sequence), pop empty BufferEmptyError precondition, clear (resets size to 0, removes all items, allows subsequent push), snapshot_items (FIFO order, non-mutating on empty/full buffer). Uses lifecycle-managed singleton pattern with LifecycleRegistry and enter_phase system scope.
